Fylvo
=====

Fylvo is a private, modified version of Cloudreve.

  Cloudreve server    https://github.com/cloudreve/cloudreve   GPL-3.0
  Cloudreve frontend  https://github.com/cloudreve/frontend    (frontend/)
  Cloudreve Desktop   https://github.com/cloudreve/desktop     MIT (desktop/)

